WEBVTT

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:21.050
School Fair Planning 
Committee announcement!

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:24.670
12' Ebisugawa School Fair

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:23.080
All club representatives from each class

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:24.970
are to meet at the third 
experimentation room.

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:26.690
Pull as hard as you can!

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:28.170
Show me what you're made of!

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:29.900
All transport vehicles 
are to follow speed limits

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.800
limits when they're in the hallway!

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:34.550
This stairway is for 
people going down only!

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:36.100
This is the planning committee!

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.550
Wearing costumes before 
the festival starts is not allowed.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:40.930
Hey, Nuko-alien over there, 
get out of the way!

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:42.810
Planetarium Café

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:42.810
Welcome

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:51.230
Maybe we should have done 
a maid café instead.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.420
We've got Izumiko-chan, after all.

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.980
Actually, where did Todayama go?

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:57.570
We're really busy over here.

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:59.360
It's pretty crazy to have

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:01.830
a school fair during 
Christmas, you know?

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:03.760
That's the way it goes.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:05.930
After the amusement park incident

00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:08.690
the school was thrown into 
chaos for a period of time.

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:13.520
Elizabeth, do you think you can get 
me that Santa doll over there?

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:16.930
Huh? Oh, sure, Itsuki-sama.

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:18.840
Thank you.

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:22.950
<i>Itsuki-sama returned 
to his previous form</i>

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:25.140
<i>due to the drug he shot himself with.</i>

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:29.610
<i>As a result, it seems he has 
regained all of his past memories.</i>

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>He seems like he hasn't changed a bit,</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:35.360
<i>but Itsuki-sama is deeply wounded</i>

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:39.270
<i>by the incident at the amusement park.</i>

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:44.090
<i>However, he won't come 
and ask me for help,</i>

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:46.410
<i>even though I'm beside him all the time.</i>

00:01:49.530 --> 00:01:51.620
Hey, what the hell is this?!

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:54.840
Whoever's in charge come forward now!

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:57.440
Why does the Astronomy Club 
have a tank, anyway?!

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:58.460
Calm down for a second...

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:00.160
This isn't a tank!

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:02.220
It's a Leopard 2 telescope!

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:03.510
That's where you were?

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:06.230
I was checking if you could 
see the stars well enough.

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:08.380
It doesn't matter because 
bringing any unauthorized

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:10.280
displays onto campus 
is against the rules!

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:12.030
Get rid of it immediately!

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:14.480
Wait just a second, President Iseda.

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:15.070
Hm...

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:16.080
That's right!

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:18.930
Once you see how wonderful 
this telescope is,

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:20.950
I'm sure you'll understand 
why it's here!

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:24.450
Huh? That thing moves?

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:26.420
Huh?

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:29.660
Oh, I screwed up.

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:36.030
S-Someone! Someone help me!

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:37.290
Help me!

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:38.920
It's nice to be young.

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:39.380
Please!

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:40.380
<b>Principal's Office</b>

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:42.510
You again, Astronomy Club?

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:44.370
Although I've been giving 
you a pass because

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:46.290
you receive support from 
the Noya Financial Group,

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:49.390
I won't hold back next time. 
Keep that in mind.

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:52.700
Are you staying overnight again today?

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:54.220
Everyone's so excited day after day...

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:55.600
running around like idiots.

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:56.980
I'm tired of it already.

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:58.010
You think so?

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:00.430
I feel like we're all camping out 
every night. It's pretty fun.

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:03.460
That's exactly why we're the 
Agonizing Astronomy Club.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:09.230
Normal humans have a hard time with 
this, unless they're an alien like you.

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:17.000
I'm not helping out here 
because I want to, you know?

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:19.000
Itsuki-sama's still here, so I'm just

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.010
helping him out because I have to.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:23.230
Hey, Izumiko...

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:24.340
What is it?

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:28.640
I've wanted to ask you this 
if I got a chance, but...

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:30.560
Why do you like Noya?

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:35.060
I don't think you're after the 
financial group's vast fortune, so...

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:38.790
I don't have anything 
left to hide anymore,

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:42.010
so I want you to tell me 
the honest truth, as well.

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:48.200
You're right...

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:57.420
Even I hated Itsuki-sama at first.

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:01.220
Midterms Results 
Announcement 
3rd Year 
1 Todayama Izumiko

00:03:58.690 --> 00:04:01.220
During summer in my third 
year in middle school...

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.760
She's too smart to have friends, I bet.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:05.320
Her sister studied too much, too,

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:06.510
and she ended up all weird.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:07.850
Definitely wanna stay away from her.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.100
We have someone transferring in today.

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:16.270
Nice to meet you.

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:19.330
I just transferred in. 
My name is Noya Itsuki.

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:20.360
Nice to meet you.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:21.430
I see.

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:24.830
He'd go around telling people

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:26.840
he was going to take over 
the Noya Financial Group,

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:28.400
with a stupid grin on his face,

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:30.880
without any real substance to him,

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:33.290
and I hated people like that.

00:04:34.050 --> 00:04:36.450
I couldn't tell what he was thinking.

00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:39.290
It almost felt like my sister...

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:42.120
Hey, come join us!

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:45.090
Don't talk to me. You're annoying.

00:04:45.730 --> 00:04:48.120
Just leave her be, Noya.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.470
You shouldn't try to get closer to her.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:52.760
She looks down on all of us.

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:54.850
She's all cocky just 
because she's smart.

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:57.600
I don't think that's it...

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:00.360
Final Exams Results 
Announcement 
3rd Year 
1 Noya Itsuki 
2 Todayama Izumiko

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:00.360
Wow!

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.500
Whatever...

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:06.860
Oh, Todayama-san.

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:09.510
The test results are up, aren't they?

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:11.220
All you do is smile like an idiot...

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:11.870
Huh?

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:15.000
I hate superficial people like you.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:15.860
Huh?

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:17.830
Wait a second!

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:21.920
Hey, Todayama-san.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.590
Don't follow me!

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:27.460
I've had enough of being forced 
to do things by stupid people!

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:29.730
Wait, Todayama-sa—

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:36.150
So you can go out on 
the roof at this school...

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:38.730
There's a step there.

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:39.410
Huh?

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.840
Wait, wait...

00:05:56.840 --> 00:05:58.960
He pulled off your panties, and that's 
how you fell in love with him?!

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.590
Of course not!

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.650
I'm not done with the story yet!

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:06.300
Well, you don't need to have 
a reason to fall in love.

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:09.110
Anyway, my darling is waiting for me,

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:10.840
so I'll be taking my leave.

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:13.470
Darlin—

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:16.670
I'm so tired...

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:20.480
Let's just call it a day and rest until morning.

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:19.880
Kotatsu heaven.

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:22.910
We're going to sleep in 
the clubroom again?

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:24.540
How many days in a row 
does that make this?

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:25.280
I'm going to sleep...

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:25.280
Who knows.

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:28.740
Anyway, I'm going to turn 
off the lights, everyone.

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:51.590
Itsuki-sama...

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:53.240
Elizabeth.

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:55.010
You can't sleep?

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:58.390
Is this a telescope?

00:06:58.390 --> 00:06:58.980
Yes.

00:06:59.490 --> 00:07:02.780
She supposedly has it here 
for some sort of research.

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:07.640
They're beautiful.

00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:09.920
It might be because it's cold out,

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:11.740
but it looks pretty clear tonight.

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:17.420
Hey, Elizabeth, do you recall...

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:21.250
when we looked at the stars together?

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:29.640
What are you doing?

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:32.300
Todayama-san...

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.280
Medicine?

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:35.260
Oh, this?

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:36.910
I'm always taking it.

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:38.640
I sometimes forget, though.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:39.380
I see.

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:41.770
I was looking at the sky.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:43.840
Would you like to join me?

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:51.330
I like looking at the sky.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:54.040
The sky doesn't belong 
to anyone, you know?

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:55.670
That's not true.

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:57.200
The sky belongs to 
each country, doesn't it?

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:59.240
That's why other countries aren't 
capable of violating our airspace—

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:00.800
Yeah, but...

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:03.960
That star, the first star up there,

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:09.210
it'd be ridiculous to talk 
about violating its airspace.

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:13.310
I'm sure us humans look 
like tiny bugs to it.

00:08:13.730 --> 00:08:15.880
All people do is focus on 
things that don't matter,

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:17.790
and worry about what 
someone else is thinking.

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:21.100
Does everyone really like 
the rich that much?

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:24.390
Everyone's so cold to you, but in the end,

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:26.730
it's over something that doesn't even matter.

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:29.480
Quite the harsh language there.

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:32.020
Huh? I guess you don't like me now.

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:35.000
I never liked you.

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:39.990
Why don't you like me, Todayama-san?

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:42.550
It's because you act like 
you're better than others.

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:46.540
No, you can only act like 
you're better than someone

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.750
when you're comparing apples to apples.

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:55.660
Todayama-san, I was probably 
raised to be in a

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:57.430
different class entirely.

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:02.760
You could say I'm the 
worst kind of person.

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:07.180
Sometimes you can't help these things.

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:07.860
Huh?

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:09.390
And if you try to change,

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:11.610
sometimes you find you 
can't be yourself anymore.

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:14.590
There was a time where I 
could only deal with people

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:16.630
by putting distance 
between myself and them,

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:18.330
so I understand how you feel.

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:22.240
Todayama-san!

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:25.490
Only you...

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:28.170
Only you're different 
from all the others!

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:34.670
Even right now, you're in 
a class higher than me.

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:37.340
You're just saying that because I'm 
standing higher up than you right now.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:39.480
No, you're always focused

00:09:39.480 --> 00:09:41.560
on things that are 
further out than I am.

00:09:42.170 --> 00:09:45.180
I find that part of you...

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:51.940
It's already been a year.

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:55.410
Back then I had things 
going on with my family...

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:57.710
So I couldn't really talk 
about how I felt to anyone.

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:04.040
But I think it's fine now.

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:08.700
There's no need for you to work

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:10.420
for me as my maid anymore.

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:13.090
This is goodbye, Elizabeth.

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:19.870
Announcement from the 
planning committee.

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:22.470
Every person in charge 
for each club from

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.620
I'm really tired...

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:26.450
each class is to gather at 
the music room. Repeating...

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:27.450
I guess this is the start 
of another long day.

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:29.710
When we did start sleeping 
at school anyway...

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:32.820
I don't remember something from so long ago.

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:33.480
Hm?

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.360
Oh, it's the student council president.

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:37.860
She looks worn out.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:39.280
It's no surprise.

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:40.680
I'm sure her body and mind are

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:42.820
both completely exhausted 
due to the hard schedule.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:44.540
I wonder if she's okay.

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:47.300
Overwork, lack of sleep, malnutrition,

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:49.060
distress of the autonomic system,

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:50.040
bad palm reading results, too...

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:54.350
Anyway, you should get some rest.

00:10:54.350 --> 00:10:56.730
My darling said that if 
you can't sleep because

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:59.840
you can't stay still, 
you should take this.

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:02.050
Tranquilizer?

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.920
You can do it, President Iseda.

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:06.340
There's only one more day left.

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:08.980
The school fair starts tomorrow.

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:13.110
It feels like I've heard 
that a bunch of times now.

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:15.750
The student who took the 
electric kotatsu from

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:17.480
Pull as hard as you can!

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:18.990
principal's office should turn 
themselves in immediately.

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:18.990
Show me what you're made of!

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:26.730
Hey, do you think these work 
for the staff's outfits?

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:28.010
Why cosplay?

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:29.690
I just thought since we were doing this,

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:32.490
it'd be good if there were 
more maids other than Izumiko-chan.

00:11:32.490 --> 00:11:33.130
Huh?

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:35.540
Why isn't she in her maid outfit today?

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.000
Why?

00:11:56.810 --> 00:11:58.210
Neko-sensei.

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:09.320
What?

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:13.740
Wait!

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:19.810
So you've come, Todayama-san.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:21.220
I've been waiting for you.

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:22.260
You're—!

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:26.870
You're a little different 
today... What happened?

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:27.930
Oh?

00:12:29.530 --> 00:12:33.210
I didn't like the people 
who were so mean to you.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:38.480
Wh-What...

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:40.800
There's nothing to be 
so surprised about.

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:43.010
This is my true power.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:45.410
As I grew older and developed,

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:50.290
I've become capable of controlling 
people using this power.

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:52.720
It's one of the secrets of how

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:54.080
the Noya family has grown so much.

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:56.950
But I've never seen 
you use that once...

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:58.800
I've been taking medicine 
this whole time, you know?

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:01.820
Even within my family, it seems 
my power is quite the threat.

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:04.440
So they've had me taking 
medicine to stop my growth

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:06.120
and prevent me from being 
able to control people.

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:10.870
It seems that I've been 
quite careful, as well.

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:12.170
Especially after...

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:13.670
...I met you.

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:23.100
If I don't do this, you won't 
even look my way, will you?

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:26.750
My other self desires you.

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:29.010
How about it, Todayama-san?

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:31.450
You think you could become my servant?

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:43.220
N-No...

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:46.550
No...

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:50.050
Th-This is wrong!

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:55.180
No! You're not the Noya I like!

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:08.280
I'm sorry, Todayama-san...

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:12.490
What have I done?

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:16.070
The original Noya?

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:19.840
I can't believe I tried to 
force you to obey me...

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:22.290
I...

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:29.900
T-Todayama-san...

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:31.720
Why did you jump?

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:36.270
Because I used that power on you...

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:38.150
That's it?

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:42.270
No. I can't bear to hurt you.

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.330
I can't forgive myself.

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:46.490
At this rate,

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:49.310
who knows when I might 
go out of control, again?

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:51.450
Are you daft?

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:56.980
I won't be controlled 
by that power of yours!

00:14:56.980 --> 00:14:59.140
Even if I do become your servant,

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:02.300
I'll do so standing above you.

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:03.280
Huh?

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:09.300
I'm trying to tell you I don't 
mind if I'm by your side!

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:18.640
Todayama-san!

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:29.100
<i>Itsuki-sama tried to protect me,</i>

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:31.160
<i>and due to the impact from 
the fall from the classroom,</i>

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:32.400
<i>he lost all of his memories.</i>

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:34.540
<i>And so I...</i>

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:36.620
<i>But now...</i>

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:49.470
Izumiko-chan, welcome back!

00:15:49.470 --> 00:15:51.350
How was the class fairing?

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:55.390
They just told me we were 
getting in the way.

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:57.880
Hey, where did you go, Izumiko?!

00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:59.890
We don't have time to slack off.

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:07.440
<i>Itsuki-sama...</i>

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:10.990
<i>What should I do now?</i>

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:13.310
<i>Itsuki-sama...</i>

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:16.370
Hey, that's not what we discussed!

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:18.790
I thought I told you to 
get rid of the tank!

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:21.520
I told you that this is a telescope.

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:24.270
Anyway, you're pretty worn out.

00:16:24.270 --> 00:16:26.200
If you really think I'm so worn out,

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:27.630
then just listen to me!

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:29.170
Anyway, this happened because

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:30.630
I took some weird medicine that—

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:34.200
If you have any complaints, 
please consult with the club adviser.

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:35.640
Anyway, go ahead.

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:37.300
No!

00:16:43.570 --> 00:16:44.290
Watch out!

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:44.670
Huh?

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:46.180
Izumiko-chan!

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:48.440
Izumiko-san!

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:54.730
Itsuki-sama!

00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:58.350
Izumiko!

00:16:58.890 --> 00:16:59.790
Noya?

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:03.120
How could this happen?!

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:08.290
Are they okay?!

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.730
Why... Itsuki-sama...

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:16.010
You don't care about 
me anymore, do you?

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:19.810
What are you saying?!

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:22.520
I mean, you told me goodbye...

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:28.260
I wanted to set you free...

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:31.690
...because I care about you 
more than anyone else.

00:17:33.270 --> 00:17:34.460
I wanted you to stay with me,

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:35.900
but not because you're my maid,

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:37.790
or because you were under my control.

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:45.120
Dummy...

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:50.950
I've always been by your side 
because I wanted to be.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:54.420
That power of yours or your 
family never mattered.

00:17:54.710 --> 00:17:56.030
Izumiko-san...

00:18:35.650 --> 00:18:38.030
I thought I wanted to have fun with

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:39.800
everyone like this forever,

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:42.810
but I realized that was a mistake.

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:45.950
Those two try hard to 
move forward every day,

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:47.850
and they taught me that.

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:49.190
I see.

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:51.950
Todayama Kyouko will terminate

00:18:51.950 --> 00:18:53.930
her engagement to Noya Itsuki.

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:56.580
The Noya family and Todayama family

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:58.850
will intertwine in 
another way, I'm sure.

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:21.300
Good morning, Izumiko-san.

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:25.270
I think I was having a dream.

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:29.340
With my sister, Kanamori-senpai, 
Hiromatsu-senpai,

00:19:29.340 --> 00:19:32.620
and Ooba-senpai... And Iseda-senpai...

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:34.600
We had an "agonizing" 
astronomy club that—

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:37.560
That wasn't a dream.

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:40.790
Then when you said 
goodbye, you really...

00:19:40.790 --> 00:19:44.030
I said goodbye to Elizabeth.

00:19:44.510 --> 00:19:46.560
I don't have a maid any longer.

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:52.040
Can I stay by your side 
from now until forever?

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:53.290
Of course.

00:20:00.230 --> 00:20:02.150
Hey there, keep going.

00:20:02.150 --> 00:20:03.010
I can't!

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:05.410
It's okay! No one's watching!

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:07.570
That's right. Don't worry about it.

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:08.600
Uh, but...

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:10.810
Being close is wonderful!

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:12.260
Of course this isn't okay!

00:20:12.260 --> 00:20:14.000
I mean, it's gross!

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:16.010
You're all totally getting shut down!

00:20:16.010 --> 00:20:18.710
You just don't like it because 
one of them's a guy.

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:21.920
It really isn't easy dealing with 
them all the time, is it?

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:20.610
In that case, Noya, wear 
this maid outfit!

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:24.300
Anyway, let us go, then.

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:31.120
Oh crap.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:34.280
Darling, wait!
